 "_comment_benchmarks": "Coverage cross-check only: listing pages of other grant sites are read for call CODES and for new item links. Anything we don't list goes to the review issue for a human to verify on the official page. Nothing is copied or published from these sites.",
 "_comment_sources_2026_09": "Added 2026-09-28: kth (KTH Start + TFF-5.1.5 kiegészítő támogatás announcements; info.kisfaludyprogram.hu programme pages now 404 — the site became a redirect hub), mak (Államkincstár pályázatos támogatások; the 2026 minimálbér-szocho window closed 2026-04-15), eismea (I3/EIC project cascade calls), eitcc. EU cascade/FSTP calls in general come from the SEDIA API (type 8) in fetch-eu-calls.mjs."
